---
description: >-
  Markdown strings ("`…`") in the title, section names, task names and
  actors draw as markdown without their wrapper (D225, #1292). A label in
  backticks without the quotes is no markdown string and is drawn as
  written (#1368). Plain labels keep their asterisks literal and still
  draw <b> and <br>.
---
journey
  title "`**Bold** and *italic* title`"
  section "`**Markdown** section`"
    "`**md** task`": 3: `**Me**`
    `*No quotes*`: 4: Me
  section Plain **section**
    Plain **task** <b>tag</b>: 5: Cat
    Two<br>lines: 2: Me, Cat
